OL,3,GNEWSATravel delays and timetable
OL,4,Achanges amid rail revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers have been warned to expect
OL,7,Fdelays and disruption as some essential
OL,8,Ftrack improvement works lead to
OL,9,Ftimetable changes this weekend.
OL,11,FRenewal work on the Great Western Main
OL,12,FLine (GWML), carried out by Network
OL,13,FRail, will impact all Great Western
OL,14,FRailway (GWR) services running in
OL,15,FWiltshire via Chippenham on Saturday
OL,16,Fand Sunday.
OL,18,FTrains will not run between Swindon and
OL,19,FBath Spa or Westbury on either day,
OL,20,Fwith replacement bus services being in
OL,21,Foperation.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
