OL,3,GNEWSATravel delays and timetable
OL,4,Achanges amid rail revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Parker, from Network Rail, said:
OL,7,F"We're grateful to passengers for their
OL,8,Fpatience while this vital work takes
OL,9,Fplace and encourage anyone planning to
OL,10,Ftravel over the weekend to check their
OL,11,Fjourney in advance and allow extra
OL,12,Ftime."
